{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_title", "source_sha256": "d06d520bebf75099feb413e1ec75149603ca6dc96d1636208fc2f28b18c87d72", "ja": "この、てのひらのなか", "zh": "在这掌心之中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f3e5e6e703b616034fd8d7e9db0802ed9bb3b3060eb41b009c357326373d3785", "ja": "恋を意識しろと周囲に焚き付けられた結果、\n必要以上にプロデューサーを意識してしまう\n百合子。だが、恋に戸惑う気持ちは最初から\n自分の中にあったものだと気づき、新曲への\n思いを新たにする。", "zh": "在周围人的起哄与鼓动下，百合子不得不\n去在意恋情，结果反而过分在意起了制作人。\n但她察觉到，对恋爱感到困惑的心情其实打从\n一开始就在自己心中，从而坚定了面对新歌的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1000_009rit", "source_sha256": "89e25a6339e9b24c03712a4ce69191482ba89e346bd4c5f3f41db63b7d57a998", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー！\nはい、ここでターン！", "zh": "一、二、三、四！\n好，这里转身！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "222f286901bbaf642910aa5849db0edd71a77858bcd4a6f41fb600c4332f6d39", "ja": "ターン！　……で、できました！\n律子さん、私、できました！？", "zh": "转身！……我、我做到了！律子姐，我做到了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "ef639313d09b27668350e441b7ba4694a1ada45599e774f8cfd1d502fd281e08", "ja": "ええ。ちゃんとできてるわ。百合子、\n振り付けは、しっかり頭に入ったみたいね。", "zh": "嗯，做得很好。百合子，你好像已经把舞蹈动作牢牢记住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "970242902a1ed6c5999614db03d3d3b52d38358db732c7cd4870c304e4d8a43a", "ja": "わ、私も……踊ってて、楽しかった……\n百合子ちゃん、本番が楽しみだね……♪", "zh": "我、我也……跳得很开心……\n百合子，好期待正式演出呀……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "651642ee26d727170a27805b148001ae68ada49572fd7c26c45c152e695cda61", "ja": "はい！　振り付けは、なんとか覚えられたので。\nあとは本番まで、完成度を上げていくだけですね！", "zh": "是的！我总算记住舞步了。\n接下来只要在正式演出前不断提高完成度就行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "cef65f98cec813fc22e8295262b410835b2a49f3e68e1f909b5c858f47ef6208", "ja": "曲の完成度を上げる……なら、\n表情のレッスンが必要だと、姫は思うのです！", "zh": "要提升歌曲的完成度……那么，\n姬认为需要进行表情方面的练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "83b31387de5c2c93ed40b06c77bdc21a4b26fda0de1d9dcd95de06587424ebe3", "ja": "表情のレッスン……\nまつりさん、それって？", "zh": "表情的课……\n祭小姐，那是指？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "2175e4fb3c670283a977f49a5ae6bc5debbcbf4532fe271bf8999a7f9b6c0287", "ja": "表情か～、なるほどなるほど……\nまつりには考えがあるってコト？", "zh": "表情啊～，原来如此原来如此……祭有什么想法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "a3e8b8fbe57510dbff2b72a73ffc9e8b11d59de4f1488d2dcf9d4c0d36978b40", "ja": "もちろんなのです！　今のままだと、\n百合子ちゃんの表情はちょっぴりかたいのです。", "zh": "当然有啦！如果保持现在的样子，\n百合子的表情稍微有点僵硬哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "20ab7c3080af9e852a71cfded6a2602f017fae3e6d2e6ba10f87883333fb3732", "ja": "いいですか？　この歌は、『恋のはじまり』なのです！\nそこのところを、しっかり意識して歌うのですよ！", "zh": "明白了吗？这首歌是《恋爱的开始》哦！\n要好好意识到这一点，再唱出来呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "6116669105a124cde761c66d6c07d7089a6ea17b5f9462a9e58d7bb5e6f8cf15", "ja": "ええっ！？　こ、恋のはじまりと言われても、\nどんな表情をすればいいのか……。", "zh": "诶诶！？可、可就算说是“恋爱的开始”，\n我也不知道该摆出什么表情……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "ae70c9337f9c55b35162ac817167f88f90d5cbc4db81e70442a7c77c0992b67e", "ja": "恋といえば、す、好きな人がいるってことだから……\nやっぱり、笑顔で歌う……でしょうか……？", "zh": "恋爱的话，就、就是指有了喜欢的人……\n果然还是要……笑着唱吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "14875f8aa1e7b9fd0481ef0ee0aaf518dbcfa9a34e26f34e37ecb88c97fd0568", "ja": "ただ笑えばいいってわけじゃないわ、可憐。\nもっと今回の曲の……歌の世界を表現しないと。", "zh": "可不是只要笑就行了，可怜。  \n还得更好地表现出这次歌曲……歌中的世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "abbe753d3e8d4296324fb03c1a8969e5b0e406f5c2744e7753ea58551c01694f", "ja": "つまり……『恋をしている乙女』になるのよ！", "zh": "也就是说……要成为“正在恋爱的少女”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "267e02a896dcfabc5e309306f6f7f3ebd5d4522b5b5b12bdfc452c169f0eb4d0", "ja": "ええっ、こ、恋！？　ううっ、ま、また恋かぁ……。\nどうして私の前には、恋が立ちふさがるんでしょう？", "zh": "诶诶，恋、恋爱！？呜呜，又、又是恋爱啊……。\n为什么恋爱总是挡在我面前呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "7a3082237bf85d29e0a95d5285b247ca912c53d236d4553993caea91b3f6f993", "ja": "恋……それは、世界が色づく魔法！\n幽閉された姫を王子が助け、恋に落ちて……。", "zh": "恋爱……那是让世界染上色彩的魔法！\n被幽闭的公主得到了王子的解救，双双坠入爱河……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "aafea0725f2c7c604c02e39a5b6f28567880c7980889aa9d58b8f261cae45791", "ja": "百合子ちゃん。\nこれは、おとぎ話ではないのですよ？", "zh": "百合子。\n这可不是童话故事哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "ecbcc5080ef3098e0ee3ab37cf4656a99f533c65fa4447e2a65f822ae102dca9", "ja": "ねえ、百合子は最近、ときめいたコトとかないの？\nなんかこう、キュンキュンしちゃうようなやつ！", "zh": "呐，百合子最近有没有什么心动的事？\n就是那种让人怦怦直跳的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "5911ebf173927d2d5ac599b2f8938d7a57519d8ce2800ed59065613d2de1ea82", "ja": "えっ！？　そ、それはですね、ええと……。", "zh": "咦！？那、那个嘛，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6383d6cdc78a1981ff96b3be7dec070cd398ea0c98aa4f4264b01e045a0799d2", "ja": "（次回の定期公演に向けて、レッスンが始まった。\n事務仕事を終えたら、百合子達の様子を見に行こう）", "zh": "（为了下一次定期公演，训练开始了。\n处理完事务后，去看看百合子她们的情况吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1020_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a81583b678f516b554f1687e195112e62115106608458f0d6db7b0bbffb13a38", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！　休憩中か……って、あれ？\n百合子、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "大家辛苦了！正在休息吗……咦？\n百合子，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "2b58dcc01a40083f89d166b440ecd5c9ed5aa78faf9ce6136986b710cdfeb857", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！？\nど、どうかしたのかって、どうしてですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！？\n你、你问我怎么了吗，这是为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1023_p", "source_sha256": "2f52ec0073f42a7413f3e02fc6a88b08fc65dd3b11fc6016c81778836f963a71", "ja": "いや、なんだか顔が赤いみたいだから……\nどうかしたのか？　風邪でもひいたのか？", "zh": "不是，只是觉得你的脸好像有点红……\n怎么了？难道是感冒了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "e1b01849dca724b0fcd677ba4e2034194b03f106c14b85a67847b8112915bf6e", "ja": "ひゃああああっ！！？\nち、近づかないでください～っ！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊！！？\n请、请不要靠近我～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1025_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "a1d651e1a8d4694743c406fc70430ac58bd4bcc7a37353695504cdd5af14b406", "ja": "この反応は……もしかして、百合子ちゃん……\n{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "这个反应是……难道说，百合子……\n{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "d1610340eea7b843a489e0bef5875f1f423158e1c1319efd7da2f120302c83dc", "ja": "{$P$}、もしかして……\n百合子のこと、キュンキュンさせた！？", "zh": "{$P$}，难道说……\n让百合子心动不已了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1028_p", "source_sha256": "ae0e9ecf371de6547e5ef0c4e5eebb851ec22327b48d42167112cfc0cc64b6f5", "ja": "キュンキュン……何の話だ？", "zh": "心动心动……你在说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "226316b833020f2404413f2c9ac9e90656143853318dffc755f5bf4bfb585f83", "ja": "り、律子さん……もしかして百合子ちゃん、\nこの前のことを……？", "zh": "律、律子姐……难道说，百合子她把之前那件事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "1b5cf767874d833bb2802b60e7db9379a34eb36f2b4517249c015c09083782d7", "ja": "あ～なるほど……。たしかに、文学少女の百合子には、\n絶好の『恋のはじまり』シチュエーションだったかも？", "zh": "啊～原来如此……确实，对身为文学少女的百合子来说，\n搞不好是极佳的“恋爱开端”情境呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1031_021mat", "source_sha256": "70b987c3330a6b2ec401e76ff142f551b6f49eae865f2df0896fc4317f35b49e", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　その調子で、\n百合子ちゃんをキュンキュンさせるのですよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！就照这个劲头，\n让百合子小鹿乱撞起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1032_020meg", "source_sha256": "9e44b07e882e9a6559a269d6b10eaff6a4af67949bc34a4b5ba99ac875d70935", "ja": "濃厚なやつ、期待してるかんね！　にゃはは！", "zh": "我期待着浓烈的那种哦！呀哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1033_045kar", "source_sha256": "ecef92407ce09ede1f1984e09adec0ad588f08de9f8da7b9ed722984ad83692c", "ja": "が、がんばってください…！", "zh": "请、请加油……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "6fa037fccab0b810b242dc1001c2c05d932323676e08cbf83e79d3482c98df70", "ja": "ち、違いますってば～！\nあうう……わ、私、失礼しますっ！", "zh": "不、不是那样啦～！\n呜呜……我、我先告辞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1035_p", "source_sha256": "6919c32ab7169610ccbff4e6cbea76e07866d4e53e585851a0dd5cb2abddef12", "ja": "あっ、百合子！？", "zh": "啊，百合子！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1036_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1037_026yur", "source_sha256": "2986579a29f01e0a2a0ff8b1a7a6d14b828dd2932faf1f4ce20ed964bab81c8f", "ja": "やっちゃった……でも、急だったから、\nビックリしちゃって……うう……。", "zh": "搞砸了……不过，因为太突然了，\n吓了我一跳嘛……呜呜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1038_026yur", "source_sha256": "d31cd81774c3db0fd90473e58738f39f3de8cf6332b208c33815933198003bcd", "ja": "{$P$}さんに、\n後でちゃんと謝らないと……はぁ……。", "zh": "必须得在之后好好向{$P$}先生道歉才行……唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1039_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1040_p", "source_sha256": "810004047fd68d432de099382f1f13b10cd105aa9aad6690631ff13df7eef253", "ja": "（その後も定期公演の準備は、順調に進んでいる。\nが、肝心の百合子と、ほとんど話せていない……）", "zh": "（那之后，定期公演的准备工作也在顺利进行着。\n可是，偏偏几乎没能和百合子说上话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1041_p", "source_sha256": "4111139adaccc5c54aed7492dd1447741b67e0429934f4bc92c8fc2ecdc2655c", "ja": "それで、カバー曲コーナーの後、全体曲への\n入り方なんだけど。一度MCを挟んだ方がいいか？", "zh": "然后，关于翻唱曲环节结束后进入全员曲的方式……要不要先安排一段MC？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1042_009rit", "source_sha256": "ec38596d0b84d2a1c14bed42da622ac3a8a04ca9b05dc128c89620aabb3b4af7", "ja": "そうですね。ここはMCで繋いで空気を変えて……。\nそれでいきましょう、{$P$}。", "zh": "对。这里用MC串起来，转换一下气氛……就这么办吧，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1043_p", "source_sha256": "c981d6c52b45c8a1786e11764ec1b40fed855415d9c64188a129732306d133a5", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。ところで、みんなの様子はどうだ？\n百合子と、あれから話せてないんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢。对了，大家现在怎么样？\n我从那以后就没和百合子聊过了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1044_009rit", "source_sha256": "a1af97bad87ffb783ed56f19f440b9b25f0cf0b1c135ce10b729d77cc3a17d30", "ja": "え？　やだ、そうだったんですか？　……って、\nウワサをすれば……{$P$}、後ろ。", "zh": "诶？哎呀，原来是这样吗？……说曹操曹操到……{$P$}，在你后面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1045_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1046_026yur", "source_sha256": "2b001e0083d861408546fa37acfd7ef9dfcfcaa4a6b779c9e60f046f769b420f", "ja": "じーっ……。", "zh": "（盯）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1047_p", "source_sha256": "f74cdfc38fe9f3831f4d34762bba4996d1267d5cd3422961bb8f883ee1cd0491", "ja": "あそこにいるのは……百合子？\nどうしてあんなところに……。", "zh": "那边的是……百合子？\n为什么会在那里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1048_026yur", "source_sha256": "c1eca0d25504fe7f515ef954c3b1e6f4fd8ee74215fe244b49c6d73039a97153", "ja": "はっ！？　ササッ……。", "zh": "啊！？　嗖地一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1049_009rit", "source_sha256": "0f034b5d7a99fb6fbab1bb6c6ec030f5ec426617c32087b6a611e2ec1d4e362e", "ja": "あっ、隠れた。\nもう百合子ったら、バレバレなのに……。", "zh": "啊，藏起来了。\n真是的，百合子这孩子明明暴露得一清二楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1050_p", "source_sha256": "9446110ee980df18dbd855594c6dab95e772e2083d9727d9d9c2e0b70af8d8e9", "ja": "う、うーん。\nなんだか、避けられてるみたいだな……。", "zh": "唔、唔——\n总觉得好像被躲着了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1051_009rit", "source_sha256": "efd03363f45c24c5a6cd51885e6e884d45d827e58719705fb3dd741931342617", "ja": "{$P$}のせいじゃないですよ。\nあの子、新曲の歌詞にちょっと悩んでるみたいで。", "zh": "这不是{$P$}的问题啦。\n那孩子好像在为新歌的歌词有些犯愁呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1052_009rit", "source_sha256": "6f8ee1289192f20dc46df18310d172c075ef762d6a2495d2cf3ef53e9b0ef270", "ja": "それに、私たちがいろいろ焚き付けたのも\n良くなかったというか……。", "zh": "而且，我们还一个劲儿地煽动她，怎么说呢……也不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1053_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1054_009rit", "source_sha256": "1f92d6750ba8f48ebf4b98d41dbdebff5ce9909b7533adee04ed0da1656720d9", "ja": "いえ、こっちの話です。百合子とは話しておきますから\n{$P$}は、公演の準備お願いします。", "zh": "不是，我只是自言自语。百合子那边我会先沟通一下，{$P$}请准备好公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1055_p", "source_sha256": "aa1ae4517ce72fd637a539978bdfed61d4bd18a8047d02a7debe18beb8e93875", "ja": "そうか……わかった。", "zh": "这样啊……我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1057_026yur", "source_sha256": "a3e843e5c1ab52c69925cdab89b98a16f3a3d90e06c950e99013b649a3a31b5d", "ja": "はぁ……また、{$P$}さんに\n謝れなかった……これで、99回め……うぅ……。", "zh": "唉……又没能向{$P$}先生道歉……这已经是第99次了……呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1058_026yur", "source_sha256": "ebe7f91d9ce939028c23d470a82dc09a344b6cfb88746dfbf9151233bc11d9f6", "ja": "勝手に意識しちゃってるだけなのに、失礼だよね……\nやっぱり、私に新曲なんて歌えないんじゃ……。", "zh": "明明只是我擅自放在心上，却显得很失礼吧……\n果然，我是不是根本唱不了什么新歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1059_020meg", "source_sha256": "7545faf0b938fd13457ef48b5ea0afe0cd9c6c751732cdf36685f326507ff82c", "ja": "百合子～。もう、悩んでるくらいなら、ちゃんと\n{$P$}に言った方がいいよ？", "zh": "百合子～。与其一直烦恼，还不如好好跟{$P$}说说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1060_020meg", "source_sha256": "77e79fbc656034b34ed5f871180232babd553850841e83e4f3f6496978879173", "ja": "アタシもさ、自分の公演でテンパっちゃった時に、\n{$P$}と可憐に話聞いてもらったよ？", "zh": "我也是啊，之前在自己的公演上慌了神的时候，{$P$}和可怜听我倾诉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1061_045kar", "source_sha256": "af6cc15b709a18688f31ea7cff55ba8cda3d7c0d62f23058d4126fd2f3862874", "ja": "わ、私も……不安なこと、{$P$}さん\nに話して……それで、勇気をもらったから……。", "zh": "我、我也是……把心里的不安跟{$P$}先生说了……然后，就获得了勇气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1062_045kar", "source_sha256": "a59fc70dd86e7e6e07f8fb15ce2edf38ae35e4e3ecdd632690151b1eb6a02ab4", "ja": "だから……百合子ちゃんも、\n{$P$}さんを信じて……。", "zh": "所以……百合子，你也要相信{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1063_026yur", "source_sha256": "6fb0418c2776747cf135391981eaf3e4f4fb3fa532fc6ac4d5f40ae2d46481c0", "ja": "恵美さん……可憐さん……。", "zh": "惠美小姐……可怜小姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1064_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1065_021mat", "source_sha256": "ef6aeeaac6c77d3ba144880341f860e0250c69222b4989f5e91ad1d06a2a5d87", "ja": "はいほー！　話は聞かせてもらったのです。", "zh": "嗨嗬——！事情我都听说了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1066_026yur", "source_sha256": "4f41abe849c9078e998c79d20a77516fd3b385657999e1c92969126fc248cac0", "ja": "きゃあっ！？　……ま、まつりさん！？\nビックリしたぁ……。", "zh": "呀！？……茉莉小姐！？\n吓我一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1067_009rit", "source_sha256": "3affc3f484d6321f696c8cafa5e5543339624e6283dd9f7bbf5fc0c6ea881149", "ja": "ちょっとまつり、脅かさないの！　百合子、\nすこし話したいことがあるんだけど、いい？", "zh": "喂，真理子，别吓人啊！百合子，我有点事想和你聊聊，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1068_009rit", "source_sha256": "b54ab150ada5a99cda7bf87028257b873ed15ab8b4d6e000062f36b784ba2e0e", "ja": "私たち、ちょっと百合子を煽るようなことを\n言い過ぎたかもしれないと思って……ごめん。", "zh": "我在想，我们可能说了太多煽动百合子的话……对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1069_026yur", "source_sha256": "07d87803c830f9881cb149afb644dfe83c7e06d4f1121b46e56732ec181f4416", "ja": "え！？　り、律子さん、そんな！\n私が勝手に、意識しちゃってるだけですから……。", "zh": "诶！？律、律子小姐，没、没那回事！\n只是我自己擅自多想了而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1070_021mat", "source_sha256": "4efdf78daa55fae233463598a6f04111386a17bf283e7c26d806d1d89c0f92d7", "ja": "そうなのです。百合子ちゃんが、ひとりで、勝手に\n意識しているのです。つまり、ひとりずもうなのです！", "zh": "就是这样。百合子只是一个人在自顾自地在意而已。也就是说，只是在唱独角戏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1071_026yur", "source_sha256": "3c2cae356300d983b3cc33899a03a1159a619bbcd4bc637f35ecaa01ab6b08f2", "ja": "ううっ！　そ、そんな、真実を口にしなくても……\n言葉の刃が、心臓に突き刺さります……。", "zh": "呜呜！没、没必要把事实说得这么明白吧……\n语言的利刃，狠狠刺穿了我的心脏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1072_021mat", "source_sha256": "1943ca32ca8d7777325fbdad04b4cba36ce45c1438216132b9f7d98173ef1bc8", "ja": "けど、『恋のはじまり』は、ひとりずもうだと\n姫は思うのです。……最初は皆、ひとりなのですよ。", "zh": "可是，姬觉得《恋爱的开始》不过是一个人的独角戏。……一开始，大家都是孤身一人的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1073_021mat", "source_sha256": "aed297b81e92586ae4c8b43ac50be15b2c5413695c273ce239017381dc64bce5", "ja": "百合子ちゃんは、恋する気持ちを意識していたのです。\nまつりはその心、表情を、忘れてほしくないのです。", "zh": "百合子曾意识到自己恋爱的心情。\n小真不希望你忘记那份心情，还有那时的表情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1074_026yur", "source_sha256": "661f85e08b68df1095e4dc7324d7df91d32b9173a1c6b9685f12b8607e8ec5d2", "ja": "まつりさん……。", "zh": "茉莉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1075_020meg", "source_sha256": "bb7048b35a89d54f5cd8b590a470a810a16d1d12ac2d7294e2708ec28e1ce494", "ja": "おおー。まつり、なんかいいコト言ったっぽい？", "zh": "哦——。小祭好像说了句挺有道理的话？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1076_021mat", "source_sha256": "b17e43941b3ee3bd730011182e9e211f16060544d16b26437849416d34b310dc", "ja": "ぽい、ではなくいいことなのですよ、恵美ちゃん。\nそれでは、今日もレッスン開始なのです♪", "zh": "不是“好像”，而是真的是好话哦，惠美。\n那么，今天也开始训练啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1078_p", "source_sha256": "28419d971f8c9c2f4a271cf32b3c96785e30383c8a753c1b053f359006ccde63", "ja": "（百合子、新曲の歌詞に悩んでるみたいだって\n律子が言ってたな。次に会ったら、話を聞こう……）", "zh": "（律子说，百合子好像正为新歌的歌词烦恼。下次见到她时，我去听听她怎么说吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1079_026yur", "source_sha256": "b02541221e132238165962834a034540f5b9249eb2afcaf9f5d570e24b0b89bb", "ja": "し、失礼します！　{$P$}さん……\nあの、今、おひとりですか？", "zh": "失、失礼了！{$P$}先生……\n那个，请问您现在是一个人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1080_p", "source_sha256": "1ee7c75fefd06b6f734e829ce9a53547e4b17f814da3cf8345a0470b884a244c", "ja": "あ！　百合子、お疲れさま。\nうん、大丈夫だけど……。", "zh": "啊！百合子，辛苦了。\n嗯，现在没事，怎么了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1081_026yur", "source_sha256": "d7aa02bb4dcf00e6a3434c998f88f4ae166a8de055462cfabbfc932b7085ee45", "ja": "はい！　あ、あの……その、ごめんなさい！\nこの前から、失礼な態度を取ってしまって……。", "zh": "是！啊，那个……对不起！\n从之前开始，我一直对您采取了失礼的态度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1082_026yur", "source_sha256": "818346dadce3f21b521ea55be133570ecea4f655096fe066fee907fdf8444752", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、何も悪くなくて。\n私が勝手に、変なふうに意識していたというか……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生没有任何错。\n只是我自己一个人胡思乱想，瞎介意起来了而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1083_026yur", "source_sha256": "407c6f8e2dfac1cf63fb0aeac9b8d9f9611bd28f033fc9dd3a09bfc09ec9694f", "ja": "それで、あの、相談なんですけど……\nあの新しい曲、本当に私が歌っていいんでしょうか？", "zh": "所以，那个……我想和您商量一件事……\n那首新歌，真的由我来唱没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1084_p", "source_sha256": "72e47fac017f66a800483c6cb7b5a08cfd6c5fc9b132eedd0156f45a7d54f7ec", "ja": "もちろんだ。あの曲を聞いた時に、この世界観を\n表現できるのは、百合子しかいないと思ったからな。", "zh": "当然可以。因为听到那首歌时，我就觉得，能够表现出这种世界观的，只有百合子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1085_026yur", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1086_p", "source_sha256": "7ee2cef04a6a17dd26a50aae34bcad08c4ccfec039e31382841351da4a11467b", "ja": "歌詞を理解するのに、色々悩んでたみたいだけど……\nまずは百合子の感じたまま、歌ってみてほしい。", "zh": "你似乎为了理解歌词而苦恼了很久……\n总之，先试着按照百合子感受到的那样唱唱看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1087_p", "source_sha256": "c057eb804fa1ef02e5b5c25542acf81827974b8c524da560281141d55fee49b3", "ja": "百合子が悩んでいるなら、悩んでいるままに届ける。\nその方が、歌の世界に導けるんじゃないかと思うんだ。", "zh": "既然百合子正在苦恼，那就把这份苦恼原原本本地传达出去。这样的话，我觉得或许更能引导人进入歌曲的世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1088_026yur", "source_sha256": "29f6357f5df86d3ab579cd6c5529ab268ea8c5e03a98eb4c67a7a8d448d00739", "ja": "私の感じたままに……歌詞の世界を……。\nじゃあもしかして、今までのことは……。", "zh": "按照我感受到的……歌词的世界……\n那么，难道说，直到现在为止的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1089_026yur", "source_sha256": "9d40c6bacd12a267385ea286cdd6117d7aa9e45726f80c91a58f6a08bd26239e", "ja": "そっか……。悩む気持ちも、戸惑う気持ちも。\n最初から、私の中にあったんだ……。", "zh": "这样啊……无论是烦恼的心情，还是困惑的心情。\n从一开始，就已经存在于我的心中了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1090_p", "source_sha256": "98cab1c46fa96ac7730f41bbabd248d18f6574bb1ce409736fac7b7732e9e1f1", "ja": "百合子？", "zh": "百合子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1091_026yur", "source_sha256": "ebf79760073c38d71d61b6308c8dad3ce6fdd1ff986e99826219c727ce071481", "ja": "……{$P$}さん。\nやっぱり私に、新曲を歌わせてください！", "zh": "……{$P$}先生。\n果然还是请让我来演唱新歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1092_026yur", "source_sha256": "c1fcef24a7c9d1cd9e855fafc073ab79eed8aaa7bf751d4678a6cc72e2bfa766", "ja": "今なら、この歌のこと……\nちゃんと表現できそうな気がするんです。", "zh": "现在的话……我觉得自己似乎能好好表现出这首歌的含义了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1093_p", "source_sha256": "150740c97f146006f084c39874d6e34bab04f7b7c0fd1bd5d1cd67dca66b8226", "ja": "そうか。\nよろしく頼んだぞ、百合子！", "zh": "这样啊。百合子，那就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1094_026yur", "source_sha256": "2fc2105745a24538fb7cc409b606ba294738a92876547f54a52e15cc7280fe61", "ja": "はい！　……あっ、それと……\n今さらなんですけど、お礼を言ってもいいですか？", "zh": "好的！……啊，对了，还有……\n虽然现在才说有点晚了，但我可以向您道谢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1095_026yur", "source_sha256": "17b8a641276e91763fffc82813da74771b4140d7389bdccce5cded5bfb658898", "ja": "この間、本を取ってくれましたよね？\nあの時のこと、ちゃんとお礼を言えなかったので。", "zh": "之前，您帮我拿到了那本书，对吧？\n因为那时候没能好好向您道谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1096_026yur", "source_sha256": "14d4d24b7f940cc9e053e70bf9a45635712b9d16232ff572d2173ec19e6d4cd3", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nあの時は本当に、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n那时候真的很谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_065_1097_p", "source_sha256": "9eea2717f4c853d6711885dc61d2d84e624d68457ad528b246bce142ebf8b1b3", "ja": "（百合子の表情に、いつもどおりの笑顔が戻った。\n……この分なら、大丈夫そうだな！）", "zh": "（百合子的表情恢复了往常的笑容。……照这样看来，应该没问题了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
